Subject: [PATCH] fix: show answer explanations in student's language; brighten
 hard-to-read text; refine level-up offer (remaining levels only,
 current-level display, persistent No dismissal)

---
 src/GakuApp.jsx | 51 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------------
 1 file changed, 37 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/GakuApp.jsx b/src/GakuApp.jsx
index 0fa93de..0c1e8dc 100644
--- a/src/GakuApp.jsx
+++ b/src/GakuApp.jsx
